HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppttyy driver appeared in 4.2BSD.  The _/_d_e_v_/_p_t_m device was added in
     OpenBSD 3.5.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The _p_t_m device will only work on systems where the _/_d_e_v directory has
     been properly populated with ppttyy device nodes following the naming con‐
     vention used in OpenBSD.  Since _p_t_m impersonates the super user for some
     operations it needs to perform to complete the allocation of a pseudo
     terminal, the _/_d_e_v directory must also be writeable by the super user.

